短稱或官稱指代待核；不補造姓名或自動合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m018-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"成公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAC","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p022","text":"五年，晉獻公滅虞、虢，虜虞君與其大夫百里傒，以璧馬賂於虞故也。既虜百里傒，以為秦繆公夫人媵於秦。百里傒亡秦走宛，楚鄙人執之。繆公聞百里傒賢，欲重贖之，恐楚人不與，乃使人謂楚曰：「吾媵臣百里傒在焉，請以五羖羊皮贖之。」。楚人遂許與之。當是時，百里傒年已七十餘。繆公釋其囚，與語國事。謝曰：「臣亡國之臣，何足問！」繆公曰：「虞君不用子，故亡，非子罪也。」固問，語三日，繆公大說，授之國政，號曰五羖大夫。百里傒讓曰：「臣不及臣友蹇叔，蹇叔賢而世莫知。臣常游困於齊而乞食銍人，蹇叔收臣。臣因而欲事齊君無知，蹇叔止臣，臣得脫齊難，遂之周。周王子穨好牛，臣以養牛干之。及穨欲用臣，蹇叔止臣，臣去，得不誅。事虞君，蹇叔止臣。臣知虞君不用臣，臣誠私利祿爵，且留。再用其言，得脫，一不用，及虞君難：是以知其賢。」於是繆公使人厚幣迎蹇叔，以為上大夫。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m022-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"晉獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m022-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"虞君","kind":"person","person_id":"2en_16a_r4i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m022-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"百里傒","kind":"person","person_id":"ylb_ttg_8dr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m022-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"百里傒","kind":"person","person_id":"ylb_ttg_8dr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m022-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m022-0048","start":48,"end":51,"surface":"百里傒","kind":"person","person_id":"ylb_ttg_8dr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m022-0056","start":56,"end":59,"surface":"楚鄙人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、短稱或官稱指代待核；不補造姓名或自動合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m022-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m022-0065","start":65,"